# API requests

## 1.Admin

### 1.1 Admin Login
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "wongrapee-s@rmutp.ac.th",
  "password": "Wongrapee333",
  "rememberMe": "false"
}

### 1.2 Admin Signup
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/auth/register-admin
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Wongrapee",
  "lastName": "Siliwarin",
  "email": "wongrapee-s@rmutp.ac.th",
  "password": "Wongrapee034-0",
  "confirmPassword": "Wongrapee034-0"
}

### 1.3 Admin Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "wongrapee-s@rmutp.ac.th"
}

### 1.3.1 Admin Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "password": "Wongrapee333",
  "resetPasswordToken": "b67d4a4d92cc20fb1622f01f8c87ec19dc12901d"
}

### 1.4 Admin Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

## 2.User

### 2.1 User Signup
# @name userRegister
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234-",
  "confirmPassword": "Test1234-"
}

### 2.2 User Login
# @name userLogin
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
content-type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234-"
}

### 2.3 User Forgot Password
# @name userForgotPassword
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com"
}

### 2.3.1 User Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "code": "144d5e6f839f1a8211b81dcef5b649f9a93d4047a2332cab6cb604e6eb51a18b9d442c35c5df41542aa4f766c4f02e9a28603c43e74021241e4887f3e164be5a",
  "password": "Test1234-",
  "passwordConfirmation": "Test1234-"
}

### 2.4 User Profile
# @name userProfile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}

## 3. Content

## 3.1 Student

### 3.1.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/api/students
content-type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Somchai Jaidee",
    "mobile": "0812345678",
    "cardId": "1100123456789"
  }
}

### 3.1.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students

### 3.1.3 List with ID (ใช้ id ที่ได้จาก 3.1.1)
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students/1

### 3.1.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9092/api/students/1
content-type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Somchai Jaidee (Updated)",
    "mobile": "0899999999",
    "cardId": "1100123456789"
  }
}

### 3.1.5 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/api/students/1

## 3.2 Subject

### 3.2.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/api/subjects
content-type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Mathematics"
  }
}

### 3.2.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/api/subjects

### 3.2.3 List with ID (ใช้ id ที่ได้จาก 3.2.1)
GET http://localhost:9092/api/subjects/1

### 3.2.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9092/api/subjects/1
content-type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Mathematics (Updated)"
  }
}

### 3.2.5 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/api/subjects/1

